  m_Name: aa1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: aa1
  title: Welcome
  content: "Your adventure begins here. This is a turn-based tactical strategy game,
    so there's no need to rush. Think carefully about each step, choose your equipment
    and units wisely, keep an eye on your resources, and success will be yours.\n\nTo
    get hints and understand the game mechanics faster, press <b>\"?\"</b> at the
    top of the screen; this will open the <b>Almanac</b> with a knowledge base.\n\nHaving
    lived your entire life in the village, you are finally about to embark on a quest
    for adventure, riches, and glory. From your father, you inherited old but still
    serviceable armor and a sword, and in a chest, you found a couple of dozen coppers.
    Before you set off, two neighboring brothers\u2014two strong lads\u2014approached
    you and offered to come along.\n\nWell, now grab everything that might be useful
    and let's go!"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b54def2c801cff44b1798f6445ec929, type: 3}
  unlocked: 1
  isNew: 0
